      "instance_name": "kevin_hart_public_figure",
      "label": "Kevin Hart as public figure",
      "description": "Kevin Hart is a well-known Black comedian and actor. His image is used in the meme to associate the harmful stereotype with a public figure, which can amplify the impact and reach of the derogatory message. His public persona is leveraged to frame the stereotype as a commentary on 'people' in general, despite the specific targeting of disabled individuals.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_b0a2614e"
      },
